    <h1>Brain Puzzle 3 Level 55 Answer: Help the man rescue the woman.</h1>

    <div class="disclaimer">Unofficial fan-made guide. Not affiliated with the developer of Brain Puzzle 3.</div>
<div class="verify-note">Two independent walkthroughs checked: this scene’s goal sentence and its move list match a second guide (showgamer) on 48% of the objects used, so the step order below is corroborated, not copied from one source.</div>
    <div class="answer-box">
      <span class="label">Quick answer</span>
