    <h2>Level 55 walkthrough: every move in order<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 1–3</span>
      <strong>Drag the grilled meat (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the grilled meat from the grill to the man. Drag the energy drink to the man. Drag the gloves to the man.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 4–6</span>
      <strong>Drag the grill (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the grill to the tentacle in the upper right. Drag the canned spinach to the sailor. Drag the anchor sign to the man.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 7–9</span>
      <strong>Drag the woman’s high heels (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the woman’s high heels to the man. Drag the rope from the mast to the man. Drag the fish from the railing to the man.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 10–12</span>
      <strong>Swipe left (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Swipe left on the woman’s hair. Swipe up on the fisherman when an exclamation mark appears above him. Drag the glue caught by the fisherman to the man.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Step 13</span>
      <strong>Drag the fisherman’s fishing rod</strong>
      <p>Drag the fisherman’s fishing rod to the man.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>If your level 55 shows “Chase Off Creep”<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <p>Brain Puzzle 3 does not hand every player the same scene at the same number: builds and
    install order differ, and both variants are on record. If the banner on your screen reads
    “Help chase away a pervert from the girl”, this is that scene, 11 moves in order:</p>
    <ol class="alt-steps">
        <li>Drag the yogurt from the car ad to the girl.</li>
        <li>Drag the dust off the car to the girl.</li>
        <li>Click on the phone in the molester's pocket.</li>
        <li>Click to open the girl's bag.</li>
        <li>Drag the pepper spray to the molester.</li>
        <li>Drag the safety hammer on the bus to the molester.</li>
        <li>Drag the figurine to the molester.</li>
        <li>Drag the long hair of the auntie on the bus to the bus driver.</li>
        <li>Drag the bone from the dog to the molester.</li>
        <li>Drag the banana peel to the molester.</li>
        <li>Drag the pervert's phone out of his pocket and hand it to the girl.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>FAQ<span class="accent">.</span></h2>

    <details><summary>What is the answer to Brain Puzzle 3 Level 55?</summary><p>In order: 1) Drag the grilled meat from the grill to the man.; 2) Drag the energy drink to the man.; 3) Drag the gloves to the man.; 4) Drag the grill to the tentacle in the upper right.; 5) Drag the canned spinach to the sailor.; 6) Drag the anchor sign to the man.; 7) Drag the woman’s high heels to the man.; 8) Drag the rope from the mast to the man.; 9) Drag the fish from the railing to the man.; 10) Swipe left on the woman’s hair.; 11) Swipe up on the fisherman when an exclamation mark appears above him.; 12) Drag the glue caught by the fisherman to the man.; 13) Drag the fisherman’s fishing rod to the man.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Why does nothing happen when I tap in Level 55?</summary><p>Because nothing on this screen answers a plain tap: all 13 moves are 11 drags, 2 swipes. Hold, then drag or swipe exactly as the step card says. In Brain Puzzle 3 a drag that starts on the wrong prop simply snaps back, which looks like a tap doing nothing.</p></details>
